# `for` の本体で反復の対象の変数に代入しても、元の list / dict を反復し続ける（M4 T3: 代入しないときだけ複製を省く）
# expect-stdout: ab
# expect-stdout: cd
# expect-stdout: 2
# expect-stdout: k1
# expect-stdout: k2
# expect-stdout: 5
def main() -> None:
    xs = ["a" + "b", "c" + "d"]
    for x in xs:
        xs = ["z" + "z"]
        print(x)
    print(len(["a", "b"]))
    d = {"k" + "1": 1, "k" + "2": 2}
    for k in d:
        d = {"z": 0}
        print(k)
    # 代入しない場合（複製を省く）。本体で要素を足しても正しく動く
    ys = ["p" + "q"]
    n = 0
    for y in ys:
        n = n + len(y)
        if n < 3:
            ys.append(y + "!")
    print(n)
